							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Conservatives are so much better in my view. Heh, just the other day I had a customer come in and she was talking about politics. She called herself liberal and said she would never vote for conservative. <br /><br />Well, I was disscussing politics with her, and it turns out that all her views on policies are conservative =-P That&#039;s what really makes me sad, people don&#039;t pay enough to politics and end up voting for what seams popular, instead of taking the time to do a little research and find someone you mostly agree with.
