								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes that is really sad. People attaching labels to themselves without really knowing what the labels mean.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" /> One of my colleagues asks his students whether they are liberal or conservative, then tests them on thier beliefs. 50% of the time, the students are found to actually be opposite of what they think they are. Liberal has become such a dirty word in this political climate, that liberals are refusing to call themselves liberals. 
