							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Actually, I kind of hate throwing the word &quot;liberals&quot; about, because it sounds like a blanket statement.&nbsp; But it does not apply to those who just simply have liberal views, they are the extreme, just like the right wing nuts on the other end of the scale.<br /><br />I just think it&#039;s funny that an Arab looking individual was taking detailed pictures of government buildings and infrastructure that had no asthetic or historical value and has people defending him as a camera buff who&#039;s just being unfairly treated because he happens to fit some racial profiling.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
